 "remarks": "Enjoy Cos Cob living in this bright and inviting one-bedroom apartment, ideally situated in a well-maintained elevator building. Cathedral ceilings enhance the open feel of the living space, while recent improvements include an updated kitchen and the addition of in-unit laundry. The residence also features one full bath and central air conditioning. Parking is plentiful, with one unassigned space in the indoor garage plus ample outdoor parking. Centrally located with convenient access to Cos Cob's shops, dining, parks, schools, and Metro-North, this updated apartment offers an easy, low-maintenance lifestyle in the heart of the community. No pets.",
